BEGIN CRUMB
v=1.2
kind=task
title=Batch tax computation in checkout
source=session.capture
project=storefront
---
[goal]
Reduce /checkout p95 latency back under 300ms by batching tax computation.

[context]
Profiling from session-01 confirmed compute_tax() in src/checkout/tax.py is
the hotspot — called once per line item. src/checkout/cart.py iterates items
serially. Batching all items into one compute_tax_batch() call removes N-1
round trips to the tax provider.

[constraints]
- Preserve exact per-item tax values (no rounding drift)
- Add a regression test in tests/test_checkout_latency.py
- Behind a feature flag for one release

[handoff]
- to=any   do=add compute_tax_batch() in src/checkout/tax.py
- to=any   do=switch src/checkout/cart.py to the batched call behind a flag
- to=human do=approve the feature flag default before rollout
END CRUMB
